    "title": "AGENTS.md defer recipe does not match the CLI it tells agents to run",
    "description": "AGENTS.md law 3 instructs 'storypole defer --kind <kind> --symbol \"<crate::path>\" --title \"...\"', but the CLI takes the title as a positional argument and spells the flag --symbols. Following the documented recipe fails with a clap usage error, which is exactly the wrong moment to fail - it is the escape hatch for out-of-scope findings.",
